  <link>https://www.lapatria.com/galerias/subintendente-de-la-policia-celebro-su-cumpleanos-en-familia</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;Subintendente de la Policía celebró su cumpleaños en familia&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="field field--name-uid field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;span lang about="https://www.lapatria.com/user/59" typeof="schema:Person" property="schema:name" datatype&gt;Alejandro Calderin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
